!!! archon/model/smoke.mat
!!! Smoke test for the finding semantic model.
!!!
!!! Exercises: constructing a location and a finding, and rendering the
!!! severity, category, location and finding summaries.

book archon.model.smoke

read everything from ny.lang.core
read everything from ny.lang.text
read everything from archon.model.severity
read everything from archon.model.confidence
read everything from archon.model.category
read everything from archon.model.location
read everything from archon.model.finding

main returns number begin paragraph
    value place is build location with target being "engine/sample.c", path being "engine/sample.c", line being 4, column being 5, excerpt being "strcpy(dst, src);"
    value item is build finding with identity being 1, rule-id being "code.unsafe-copy", title being "Unbounded copy", detail being "A copy without a destination bound", level being severity.High, certainty being confidence.Likely, domain being category.Code, place being place, guidance being "Use a bounded copy."

    say item.title
    say "kind=" plus item.title
    say "level=" plus (severity-name with level being item.level)
    say "domain=" plus (category-name with domain being item.domain)
    say "where=" plus (location-summary with place being item.place)
    say (finding-summary with item being item)
    say "rank=" plus (ny.lang.text::int_to_string_i64 with n being (severity-rank with level being item.level))

    give 0
end paragraph
